@startuml
title 图6-3 订单创建时序图

skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor 用户 as U
participant 小程序 as MP
participant AppOrderController as AC
participant IClGoodsService as GS
participant IClOrderService as OS
database MySQL as DB

U -> MP : 提交订单
MP -> AC : POST /api/app/order/create
AC -> GS : 查询商品与库存
GS -> DB : SELECT cl_goods
DB --> GS : 商品数据
GS --> AC : 校验结果
AC -> OS : 生成订单号并写订单
OS -> DB : INSERT cl_order
OS -> DB : INSERT cl_order_item
AC -> GS : 扣减库存
GS -> DB : UPDATE cl_goods.stock
AC --> MP : orderId/orderNo/totalAmount

@enduml
